OL,3,GNEWSATeeth-whitening pair jailed over
OL,4,A#8.5m tax fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men whose multi-million-pound
OL,7,Fteeth-whitening tax scam helped fund
OL,8,Flavish lifestyles, including plans to
OL,9,Fbuild villas in Florida with matching
OL,10,Fteeth-shaped swimming pools, have been
OL,11,Fjailed.
OL,13,FIan Barnes, 53, and Alastair Ramage,
OL,14,F44, both from Merseyside, admitted
OL,15,Ffailing to pay over #8.5m in VAT and
OL,16,Fincome tax from profits of importing
OL,17,Fand selling dangerous teeth-whitening
OL,18,Fproducts.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
