OL,3,GNEWSATeeth-whitening pair jailed over
OL,4,A#8.5m tax fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir spending included #16,000 on a
OL,7,Fbaseball cap, #100,000 on holidays and
OL,8,Fluxury cars. Other seized items
OL,9,Fincluded premium jewellery, cash and a
OL,10,Fsolid gold bar.
OL,12,FThey admitted fraud offences at an
OL,13,Fearlier hearing and were sentenced at
OL,14,FLiverpool Crown Court today.
